<section class="container page-header narrow"><p class="eyebrow">ROOTED IN THE NEIGHBORHOOD</p><h1>A good meal<br>brings us <em>together.</em></h1><p class="lede">TaftEats is a food journal for the community around DLSU Taft. A place for honest recommendations, thoughtful conversations, and the little discoveries that make a neighborhood feel like home.</p><img class="about-art" src="/images/table.svg" alt="A shared table with a warm meal and coffee"><div class="panel prose"><h2>Everyone has something to bring.</h2><p>Find a restaurant, share a review, or hear the story from the people behind the counter. Restaurant owners can respond to their own community and reviewers can continue the conversation.</p><h2>Honest stories, thoughtful conversations.</h2><p>Write from your own experience. Be specific, be respectful, and help the next person make a better choice. Reviews reflect individual experiences, not verified restaurant claims.</p><h2>From a classroom to the community.</h2><p>Originally created as a collaborative CCAPDEV academic project, TaftEats has been revived with stronger security, accessible interfaces, and an emphasis on reliable engineering.</p><div class="credits"><div><strong>Clyde</strong><span>Original frontend</span></div><div><strong>Jasper</strong><span>Original backend</span></div><div><strong>Bullet</strong><span>Full stack & revival</span></div><div><strong>Ella</strong><span>Original project management</span></div></div></div></section>
